A '''Rockmite''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Rockmites''' have a {{Chance|25%|1|4}} chance to spawn from any of {{Green|20}} mounds in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. Spawn chance can be increased with {{stat|tracking}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Rockmite''' mounds sit on the ground. Upon being interacted with, a mound begins to break. Upon breaking, a either a '''Rockmite''' or nothing is found. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Rockmite''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

